														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4756836">
									

<p>I love this kind of SCP! It made me think would I rather die a human being or live on through a bizarre existence as something <em>else.</em> Something unnatural. In this case a Snowman. I particularly like that the farmer isn't sure yet how he feels about his new &quot;life.&quot; I certainly hope you will expand on the lore of this SCP in the future.</p>
<p>That said, I do have a question. You wrote that no one can pass through the barrier but you also stated that interviews are done beyond it? I'm not sure I understand. I may just be reading it wrong though. Also, I feel like the child's dialog is a little off putting. I understand that you wanted him to speak like a young child but it didn't feel natural in my opinion.</p>
<p>All in all though I think this is a great article. +1 for sure!</p>

